[92.786857, "o", "  rank 0: id=5 score=2.8526124954223633  Her first car was a small hatchback she loved dearly for yea\r\n  rank 1: id=2 score=2.8526124954223633  He parked his car in front of the small bakery near the corn\r\n  rank 2: id=0 score=2.8526124954223633  She drove her car to the airport very early on Monday mornin\r\n  rank 3: id=4 score=2.7354300022125244  Repairing a car engine often requires expensive replacement \r\n  rank 4: id=3 score=2.7354300022125244  The blue car raced past the finish line in absolute record t\r\n  rank 5: id=1 score=2.627495050430298  My friend's car broke down on the busy highway last weekend \r\n\r\n=== Run plain FTS twice ===\r\n"]
