[210.656262, "o", "Expanded query: 'car REDACTED REDACTEDmobile machine'\r\n"]
[210.662933, "o", "\r\nAll results with scores:\r\n  id=  2 score=2.853  He parked his car in front of the small bakery near the corner.\r\n  id=  0 score=2.853  She drove her car to the airport very early on Monday morning.\r\n  id=  5 score=2.853  Her first car was a small hatchback she loved dearly for years.\r\n  id=  3 score=2.735  The blue car raced past the finish line in absolute record time today.\r\n  id=  4 score=2.735  Repairing a car engine often requires expensive replacement parts and \r\n  id=  8 score=2.689  An REDACTEDmobile assembly line is a marvel of modern industrial engineeri\r\n"]
[210.663048, "o", "  id=  1 score=2.627  My friend's car broke down on the busy highway last weekend evening.\r\n  id=  7 score=2.574  Restoring a vintage REDACTEDmobile takes patience, specialized tools and s\r\n  id=  6 score=2.574  The REDACTEDmobile industry has rapidly transformed thanks to electric pow\r\n  id= 12 score=2.574  Buying a new REDACTEDmobile is a significant financial commitment for most\r\n  id= 13 score=2.574  An REDACTEDmobile race across the dusty desert attracted thousands of chee\r\n  id= 10 score=2.468  The local museum proudly displays an antique REDACTEDmobile from the roari\r\n  id= 11 score=2.468  Modern REDACTEDmobile safety standards include airbags, crumple zones and \r\n  id=  9 score=2.468  Insurance for a luxury REDACTEDmobile can be quite expensive every single \r\n"]
[210.791375, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@fc2ffc99-f6cb-4248-a726-8c98273b5829:/home/user/myproject# "]
